scservo_sdk — Feetech SCServo Python SDK
======================================================================

This directory contains the Feetech SCServo Python SDK, redistributed
unmodified as a dependency of SCS0009_ServoController. This tool cannot
communicate with SCS0009 servos without it.

It is third-party software and remains the property of its authors:

